  "body": "matrix.org inserts a *lot* of rows into `event_push_actions` (and `_staging`) for users that have long since disappeared. We should do something to reduce that.\r\n\r\n(We insert a row per user per room for each event that notifies people, so messages in large rooms cause a lot of rows to be inserted)",
